{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 62, :comments ["<b>Three and twenty thousand.</b> This matter proves that the plague had consumed among them, for they were counted from a month old, and over thirty-eight years only a thousand were added to their number, whereas Israel who died and who were twenty years old and upward — their number now is close to the count at the wilderness of Sinai."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:19:54.913003772Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}